------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Applies to the shader files: src/orbs/orb-01.ts through src/orbs/orb-33.ts, and the compiled copies under lib/.

All 33 shaders are original work by XorDev (https://x.com/XorDev). They were published in the shadercn project
(https://github.com/shadcn-labs/shadercn) with the author's permission, and are redistributed here on the same terms. The
